{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24052","headline":"池上清晨候皇甫郎中 · 白居易","name":"池上清晨候皇甫郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓景丽未热，晨飙鲜且凉。\n池幽绿苹合，霜洁白莲香。\n深扫竹间迳，静拂松下牀。\n玉柄鹤翎扇，银甖云母浆。\n屏除无俗物，瞻望唯清光。\n何人拟相访，嬴女从萧郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}